{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.poster.avif?t=1755545349\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.webm?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.mp4?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW STATE</strong> is a single-player speedrunning FPS that puts <strong>parkour and gunplay together</strong> for stylish, high-speed shootouts. Die, retry, and shave seconds off your time to climb the leaderboards as you get better with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.poster.avif?t=1755545349\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.webm?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.mp4?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll <strong>slow time to land impossible shots</strong>, then slide around corners, wall-run across gaps, and blast through enemies midair. FLOW STATE is about <strong>feeling cool <i>and\u00a0</i>improving</strong> every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1755545349\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras_big/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1755545349 width=800 height=358 /></span><br>Racing against the clock will earn you medals, but that\u2019s just the start. <strong>To</strong> <strong>climb the leaderboards</strong>, discover new routes that shave seconds off your fastest runs. Whether you\u2019re an FPS pro or a speedrunning beginner, FLOW STATE makes you want to go again, and again\u2026 and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854860?t=1755545349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/7b79276ecc168fae86e616663aa351b6b27112ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755545349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/5201bef866f8a155828c38dfd12748981f5815c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755545349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/5201bef866f8a155828c38dfd12748981f5815c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755545349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game has violence and enemies are killed without gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.poster.avif?t=1755545349\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.webm?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/8771051d63da21caa500d7d8beeb0e20.mp4?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW STATE</strong> is a single-player speedrunning FPS that puts <strong>parkour and gunplay together</strong> for stylish, high-speed shootouts. Die, retry, and shave seconds off your time to climb the leaderboards as you get better with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.poster.avif?t=1755545349\" width=476 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.webm?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/17ecad18d627cd0f5324b0939505c304.mp4?t=1755545349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll <strong>slow time to land impossible shots</strong>, then slide around corners, wall-run across gaps, and blast through enemies midair. FLOW STATE is about <strong>feeling cool <i>and\u00a0</i>improving</strong> every time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1755545349\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/extras_big/149162320b87169b63377d2feac45f2f.avif?t=1755545349 width=800 height=358 /></span><br>Racing against the clock will earn you medals, but that\u2019s just the start. <strong>To</strong> <strong>climb the leaderboards</strong>, discover new routes that shave seconds off your fastest runs. Whether you\u2019re an FPS pro or a speedrunning beginner, FLOW STATE makes you want to go again, and again\u2026 and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ShawnBuildsGames"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Supabase ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854860/7080c576d8f67bf65b28e9cd75fc72ec1cce4e05/header.jpg?t=1755545349","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854860/940241798/364eef5d9eb4e4a9068550cf74ab6254b031cfa8/1751493970/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754748868","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854860/940241798/364eef5d9eb4e4a9068550cf74ab6254b031cfa8/1751493970/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754748868","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3854860/940241798/364eef5d9eb4e4a9068550cf74ab6254b031cfa8/1751493970/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754748868","id":257164676,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164676/movie480.mp4?t=1754748868","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164676/movie_max.mp4?t=1754748868"},"name":"FLOW STATE Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164676/1544fd7861dc827414ef69fbe13a3d3dd8364eb2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754748868","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164676/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754748868","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164676/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754748868"}}],"name":"FLOW STATE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</s